#: 917ff54540ea486a83fa28955df3ed9b
msgid "最后参考 [配方示例（Recipes）](recipes.md) 组织多卡流程。"
msgstr "Then use [Recipes](recipes.md) to assemble a multi-card workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:38
#: 235747c377764f7d9bf0d6b290b097f3
msgid ""
"涉及 `FPS Filter` 的高通量流程，通常先导出 `xyz`，在 `NEP Dataset Display` "
"里清洗明显异常结构，再做代表性采样。清洗时可以用内置 NEP89 或当前体系已有模型做预筛， 但不要把它们当作 DFT 标签。`FPS "
"Filter` 本身适合做末端代表性筛选，不适合替代结构生成卡片。"
msgstr ""
"In a high-throughput workflow that ends with `FPS Filter`, first export "
"the candidate pool as XYZ and remove obvious failures in `NEP Dataset "
"Display`, then perform representative selection. The built-in NEP89 model"
" or an existing model for the same chemical system can help with "
"preliminary screening, but its predictions are not DFT labels. `FPS "
"Filter` belongs near the end of the pipeline; it selects from candidates "
"and does not replace structure generation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:43
#: 43c0797a2304451d82f1e6a07785de64
msgid "30 秒确定方向"
msgstr "Choose a direction in 30 seconds"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:45
#: 4f34147ff4944b2eac84191d5be26691
msgid "先判断你要改变什么，再进入对应小表。不要从四十张卡片中逐个试："
msgstr ""
"Decide what you need to change before opening the corresponding table; do"
" not try forty cards one by one:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:47
#: e6c2879b797e45c98589eb4efd4ae224
msgid ""
"没有初始结构\n"
"├─ 从标准晶型开始 → 晶体原型构建\n"
"└─ 从随机坐标开始 → 随机原子堆积\n"
"\n"
"已经有初始结构\n"
"├─ 改晶胞或坐标 → 晶胞、应变与扰动\n"
"├─ 改元素和组成 → 合金与组成\n"
"├─ 改原子数或表面 → 缺陷与表面\n"
"├─ 改磁矩 → 磁性构型\n"
"├─ 做分子或溶剂 → 分子与溶剂\n"
"└─ 不再生成，只想清洗或选代表结构 → 过滤与采样\n"
msgstr "No initial structure\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:61
#: e7fe11cf3fd1466180ebbeb68e75c0c0
msgid "如果一条任务跨越多步，例如“生成表面并加入吸附原子”，先找改变边界条件的主卡， 再接局部操作卡。完整串联方式见[配方示例](recipes.md)。"
msgstr ""
"When a task spans multiple steps, such as generating a surface and adding"
" adsorbates, choose the card that changes the boundary conditions first, "
"then add local-operation cards. See [Recipes](recipes.md) for complete "
"workflows."

