msgstr "Cards that are easy to confuse"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:137
#: be66863b88bb451c92ce65f31c51a700
msgid "随机表面板层 vs 全局随机空位"
msgstr "Random Slab vs. Global Random Vacancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:139
#: 06a0469a5c57456183111cac4a131ecc
msgid "`Random Slab` 改的是边界条件和表面取向，结果会引入真空层与自由表面。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Slab` changes surface orientation and cell geometry, introducing "
"vacuum and free surfaces."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:140
#: a23bcb5441574db28e72c443d073670f
msgid "`Vacancy Defect Generation` 改的是体相或表面内部的删位强度，不会自动生成表面。"
msgstr ""
"`Vacancy Defect Generation` removes sites from an existing bulk or "
"surface structure; it does not create a surface by itself."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:141
#: bfd0047e5d0c4118bcefef725a301da0
msgid ""
"想研究“表面缺陷”，通常先 `Random Slab`，再 `Insert Defect` 或 `Vacancy Defect "
"Generation`。"
msgstr ""
"For surface defects, usually run `Random Slab` first, then `Insert "
"Defect` or `Vacancy Defect Generation`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:143
#: 01010da6322a4380a4f783a9f01f82c5
msgid "随机掺杂 vs 成分空间采样 vs 随机占位"
msgstr "Random Doping vs. Composition Space Sampling vs. Random Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:145
#: 548c732d6aae40a6a1cdfb54cb340f04
msgid "`Composition Space Sampling` 负责定义“目标配比空间”，输出仍是带目标配比标签的结构副本。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Space Sampling` defines the target composition space; its "
"output remains structure copies carrying target-composition labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:146
#: b148308f8ec4422cb09d9cce31983f85
msgid "`Random Occupancy` 负责把目标配比真正落到离散原子位点上。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Occupancy` realizes each target composition on discrete atomic "
"sites."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:147
#: cd5b7192f9a2485eb969202775989fcb
msgid "`Random Doping` 更适合“给定规则后直接做一次随机替换”，而不是系统地扫完整配比空间。"
msgstr ""
"`Random Doping` is better for applying explicit random substitution rules"
" than for scanning a complete composition space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:149
#: 993857c2ddd74ee2b0d17fcf88c31579
msgid "有序合金原型 vs 有限晶胞合金占位"
msgstr "Ordered Alloy Prototype vs. Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:151
#: a35b3bbf11cb44e7be16598501afa339
msgid "`Ordered Alloy Prototype` 建立晶胞、周期边界、分数坐标和 A/B 晶体学子晶格，不负责枚举组成。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype` creates the cell, periodic boundaries, "
"fractional coordinates, and crystallographic A/B sublattices; it does not"
" enumerate compositions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:152
#: 8c2d0f3581564f288b0be1173a717ef5
msgid "`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy` 接收已有位点或子晶格，先确定可实现的整数计数，再生成不重复排布。"
msgstr ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy` accepts existing sites or sublattices, "
"first determines realizable integer counts, and then generates unique "
"arrangements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:153
#: bd1cf9837ee647668ee0e9eb48282183
msgid "要覆盖 L1₂、B2、L1₀ 的有序到部分无序路径，通常先生成原型，再做有限晶胞占位。"
msgstr ""
"To cover ordered-to-partially-disordered paths for L1₂, B2, and L1₀, "
"generate the prototype first and then apply finite-cell occupancy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:155
#: 1608ac6c8fa54be4947f609fb66a6d36
msgid "原子扰动 vs 振动模式扰动"
msgstr "Atomic Perturb vs. Vib Mode Perturb"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:157
#: b8f4d92883674d04909b3efbc108a291
msgid "`Atomic Perturb` 是无模型的随机位移，适合快速补近平衡噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`Atomic Perturb` adds model-free random displacements for quick near-"
"equilibrium augmentation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:158
#: 9527de1e4ca649f68dad03e3bc9575ba
msgid "`Vib Mode Perturb` 基于已有振动模态，适合更接近特定频率空间的位移采样。"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` uses existing normal modes to sample selected regions "
"of vibrational-coordinate space."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:159
#: 24f7fe8763cd42af8020c130d2bc6d5d
msgid "输入里没有模态数组时，不能直接用 `Vib Mode Perturb`。"
msgstr ""
"`Vib Mode Perturb` cannot operate until the input contains recognized "
"mode arrays."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:161
#: d675d3d06fc846f38079d1b213512ab2
msgid "层错只保留一个新建入口"
msgstr "Use one creation entry for stacking faults"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:163
#: 55be924b9ed84a7d8e9b77d20075025c
msgid ""
"新任务统一使用 `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path`，显式填写 `plane_hkl`、位于面内的 "
"`slip_uvw`、切面位置和位移路径。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Stacking Fault / GSFE Path` for new tasks and specify `plane_hkl`, "
"the in-plane `slip_uvw`, the cut position, and the displacement path "
"explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:164
#: bd4f1272df624916bd656056523b89e6
msgid ""
"它不限材料和晶面，但要求输入已经定向：第三晶胞方向必须垂直于 `plane_hkl`。普通 cubic fcc cell 若要扫原始 "
"`(111)` 面，应先用 `Crystal Prototype Builder` 的 `fcc111` 原型或自行构造已定向晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"It is not restricted to a material or plane, but the input must already "
"be oriented: the third cell direction must be perpendicular to "
"`plane_hkl`. To scan the original `(111)` plane of a conventional cubic "
"fcc cell, first use the `fcc111` prototype in `Crystal Prototype Builder`"
" or construct an oriented cell yourself."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:165
#: 73923375fdc04f318ba319ccaede079d
msgid ""
"旧 `StackingFaultCard` 仍保留在序列化注册表中，用于载入历史 "
"JSON；因为它自动从全局笛卡尔轴推导滑移方向，所以不再显示在“添加新卡片”和“查找卡片”中。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy `StackingFaultCard` remains in the serialization registry for "
"loading historical JSON. Because it derives the slip direction from "
"global Cartesian axes, it is no longer shown in `Add new card` or `Find "
"card`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:167
#: 7ee4dc2b1c30488b93b22f322c107e7d
msgid "设置磁矩 vs 磁序 vs 磁矩旋转"
msgstr "Set moments vs. magnetic order vs. moment rotation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:169
#: 47a98ef091e04ec2993d3de278c1dbca
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` 只负责把磁矩写进去，适合静态初始化。"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` writes one consistent moment state and is intended"
" for static initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:170
#: 7b72422df8644554bb1e69a22e40b5cc
msgid "`Magnetic Order` 会生成 FM / AFM / PM 等多磁态分支。"
msgstr "`Magnetic Order` branches into FM, AFM, and PM-like initial states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:171
#: a081b72630794983bee4d8ddeeeba5b3
msgid "`Magmom Rotation` 基于已有磁矩做角度扰动，适合补充非共线或局部旋转样本。"
msgstr ""
"`Magmom Rotation` perturbs existing directions and is suitable for local "
"noncollinear augmentation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/index.md:173
#: 361b554f119844ed99525f0ae3ca4478
msgid ""
"磁性卡片对外统一使用 NEP / Show NEP 的 `spin:R:3` EXTXYZ 字段。卡片内部仍同步维护 ASE 的 "
"`initial_magmoms`，用于兼容 ASE 操作和旧工作流；导出文件只保留 `spin`。读取已有磁矩时优先使用 "
"`spin`，只有输入没有 `spin` 时才回退到旧的 `initial_magmoms`。标量模式会按卡片中明确设置的 `Axis` "
"转成三分量 `spin`；零向量 Axis 会明确失败，不会静默假设方向。"
msgstr ""
"Magnetic cards use the NEP / Show NEP `spin:R:3` EXTXYZ field as their "
"external contract. Internally, they also keep ASE `initial_magmoms` in "
"sync for ASE operations and legacy workflows; exported files retain only "
"`spin`. Existing moments are read from `spin` first and fall back to "
"legacy `initial_magmoms` only when `spin` is absent. Scalar mode converts"
" values to three-component `spin` vectors using the card's explicit "
"`Axis`; a zero Axis fails clearly instead of silently assuming a "
"direction."

